## Final Selected Idea

**Comic Craft AI** is an AI-powered platform that helps users create comics from their own story ideas. The system can generate comic panels, characters, dialogues, backgrounds and other comic elements, making comic creation easier and faster.

### Key Features

- AI-based story-to-comic generation
- Automatic comic panel creation
- AI-generated characters and dialogues
- Background and speech bubble generation
- Multiple comic genres
- Export the final comic as an image or PDF
